+<!-- MACHINE-DRAFT:design-risks:03ff22f024c81093b38d2bb78b9d095acf5be70d5c09b17c10da44e4655ddb72:begin 机器预填段——整段改写会被 flow done 拒收；确要修改：sillyspec flow amend-draft --change 2026-09-25-thin-review-slice 留痕重锚 -->
